00:00:00.456 --> 00:00:02.713
Unit eight. Sportsmanship!

2
00:00:03.687 --> 00:00:10.115
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level four!

3
00:00:10.165 --> 00:00:13.851
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:17.676
Today we learn: Sportsmanship. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.334 --> 00:00:23.201
Fair play. Say it with me. Fair play!

6
00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:30.493
Integrity. Say it with me. Integrity!

7
00:00:34.005 --> 00:00:38.621
Respect opponents. Say it with me. Respect opponents!

8
00:00:42.131 --> 00:00:46.598
Graceful loser. Say it with me. Graceful loser!

9
00:00:50.048 --> 00:00:53.765
Humble winner. Say it with me. Humble winner!

10
00:00:57.270 --> 00:01:00.536
Ethics. Say it with me. Ethics!

11
00:01:04.009 --> 00:01:08.159
Code of conduct. Say it with me. Code of conduct!

12
00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:15.304
Referee. Say it with me. Referee!

13
00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:22.620
Discipline. Say it with me. Discipline!

14
00:01:26.141 --> 00:01:30.275
Team spirit. Say it with me. Team spirit!

15
00:01:33.782 --> 00:01:37.298
Honor. Say it with me. Honor!

16
00:01:40.799 --> 00:01:45.432
Sporting behavior. Say it with me. Sporting behavior!

17
00:01:48.919 --> 00:02:00.378
Grammar time! even though / no matter what. Listen. Even though we lost, we stayed respectful. No matter what happens, play fair.

18
00:02:00.428 --> 00:02:07.853
Your turn. Say it with me. Even though we lost, we stayed respectful. No matter what happens, play fair.

19
00:02:12.811 --> 00:02:20.634
Fair play and integrity define good sportsmanship. Respecting opponents and being a graceful loser matters more than winning.

20
00:02:20.684 --> 00:02:22.060
I like this story!

21
00:02:23.158 --> 00:02:28.377
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:28.427 --> 00:02:30.029
Respect opponents!

23
00:02:31.093 --> 00:02:36.249
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:36.299 --> 00:02:37.670
Code of conduct!

25
00:02:38.692 --> 00:02:47.684
Think and answer. Why is sportsmanship important, even more than winning?

26
00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:48.910
Great answer!

27
00:02:50.324 --> 00:02:55.804
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
